sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User / agent
  participant A as CLI, hook, MCP, or dashboard
  participant W as WorkspaceStateStore
  participant R as Approved routing read model
  participant S as routeSemanticDecision
  participant C as Contract validator

  U->>A: prompt
  A->>W: openApprovedWorkspaceRead(routing)
  W-->>A: current approved revision or LKG
  A->>R: build ApprovedRoutingState
  R->>S: prompt + effective registry + max
  S-->>R: recommendations + exclusions + compact hook text
  R->>C: validate route-result/v2
  C-->>R: valid digest-bound result
  R-->>A: route result; promptStored=false
  A-->>U: recommendations / hook hint / trace

  Note over W,C: Runtime routing is offline, deterministic, revision-bound, and fail-closed.
